<div class="page-prose"><h1>About PHP Hub</h1>
<p>PHP Hub is run by a PHP and Laravel developer based in Mohali, India, with 6 years of experience.</p>
<p>The aim is simple: explain PHP and WordPress security issues in plain language, say clearly who is affected and what to do, and link to the original sources so you can check the facts yourself.</p>
<h2>How briefs are written</h2>
<ul><li>Every brief links to its primary sources (vendor advisories, php.net, CISA, researchers).</li><li>Severity and exploitation status are shown only when a source states them.</li><li>Unverified claims are labelled as such.</li></ul>
<p>Need help with a site? See <a href="/services">services</a> or <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.</p></div></Base>
